## xcodegen-generated project (regenerate via `make generate`)
## ただし SPM の Package.resolved は再現性のため追跡したいので negation 対で書く。
Tide.xcodeproj/*
!Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace
Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/*
!Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata
Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/*
!Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm
Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/*
!Tide.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

